{100}{}{Marcelle}
{200}{}{You see Marcelles.}
{210}{}{You see a tough-looking woman.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> go_to_room]}
{2000}{}{Thank god you're here! Some crazy guy has Sinthia held hostage. He's threatening to kill
her! You've got to help.}
{2010}{}{Nah, don't bother me.}
{2020}{}{Hmm. I'll check it out.}
{2030}{}{Dung!}
{3000}{}{You are an incredibly cold person. She could die without your help.}
{3010}{}{Tough. That's life.}
{3020}{}{All right, don't harp on me. I'll look into it.}
{4000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Marcelles02a']}
{4010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Marcelles_charge_raider]}
