{8000}{}{Oh, geez, I hope you can do it. He's in her room. Help her!}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{Help Sinthia. She's in trouble.}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{Thank you for helping Sinthia. She's usually not a problem. You deserve a good night's
sleep. On me. But don't ask for another freebie.}
{10010}{}{Hnn. Thug.}
{10020}{}{Thanks.}
{11000}{}{Enjoy your stay. Don't be a pain.
---
No problem. Room #1. Follow me.}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{You should have saved Sinthia. It's your fault she died. I hope you are happy with
yourself.}
{12010}{}{Yeah, whatever.}
{12020}{}{Hnnn.}
{12030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BigDownReact]}
{13000}{}{You killed Killian, didn't you?}
{13010}{}{Yep, sure did.}
{13020}{}{Nah, wasn't me. Really it wasn't.}
{13030}{}{Hnn.}
{14000}{}{You son of a bitch. I can't believe you killed him. He was a good man, and now I get all
sorts of hell . . . get out, and don't come back.}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Marcelles29a']}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Marcelles31]}
{15020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Marcelles32]}
{16000}{}{Yeah, whatever you say, but that's not what I heard. You'd better behave around here, or
I'll get out ol' Betsy and ram some buckshot up your ass.}
{16010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> BigDownReact]}
{17000}{}{Get out! You're too dumb to realize what you did, but my life is hell now!}
{17010}{}{[Done.]}
{18000}{}{Welcome to the Crash House. How can I help you, stranger?}
{18010}{}{I'm looking for some water.}
{18020}{}{I need a good night's sleep.}
{18030}{}{I'm looking for some info.}
{18040}{}{Hnnn.}
{19000}{}{Then you should try the Skum Pitt. I heard you can get a lot of water in your booze
there.}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{I don't know about that, but I will rent you a room. It's a good place to rest and heal
up. $25 for a day, or a week is $150. Most people go for the weekly rate. You should, if
you ask me.}
{20010}{}{No, thanks.}
{20020}{}{Just one night.}
{20030}{}{Okay. A week.}
